  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Financial Assessment Bagamoyo EcoEnergy</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Finansiell bed&#xf6;mning Bagamoyo EcoEnergy</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Genom ramavtalet Sveriges Ambassad i Tanzania har med KPMG gavs de uppdraget att g&#xf6;ra en bed&#xf6;mning av den finansmodell som EcoEnergy har f&#xf6;r sitt projektf&#xf6;rslag. Uppdraget genomf&#xf6;rdes under 2015. Betalning skulle skett genom den projektfond som ambassaden hade under 2015 men den insatsen st&#xe4;ngdes 31 december 2015 innan fakturan f&#xf6;r KPMGs arbete kunde hanteras. D&#xe4;rav nytt beslut och insats f&#xf6;r att kunna hantera fakturan.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Through the framework agreement the Swedish Embassy in Tanzania has with KPMG they were given the assignment to do an assessment of the finance model EcoEnergy has for their Project. The assessment was undertaken in 2015. The payment was planned to be from the Embassy Project Development Fund but that fund was terminated 31st December, 2015, Before the invoice from KPMG was processed. Hence a new decision and contribution is needed to process the invoice.</narrative>
  </description>
